    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 17/06/2026, the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted on 17/06/2026 and numbered 4155-01, 4155-02, 4155-03, 4155-04, 4155-05, Fire Safety Strategy, Photographs was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. \r\n\r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class B, Clause B.1(f) of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) as the site is located within Thorney Hedge Conservation Area of which roof extensions are not permitted development and will require an application for planning permission.\r\n"
